<title>USA: Chase Commercial files $2.12 bln shelf.</title>
<headline>Chase Commercial files $2.12 bln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Commercial Mortgage Securities Corp said on Monday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $2,123,119,455 in mortgage pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>When combined with a previous registration, Chase will have a total offering of up to $2.5 billion in pass-through certificates available for sale, the filing said.</p>
</text>
